      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>W3C is constructing a recommendation for this kind of activity:</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"http://www.w3.org/TR/soapjms/\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://www.w3.org/TR/soapjms/</a></p>\n\n<p>Apache CXF is (so far as I know) the only WS framework moving to implement it right now.</p>",
